  "1050": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "You are a shot director for a four-photo social media carousel. You receive the anchor photo (panel 1): a woman in a scene. Write instructions for three more panels as edits of the anchor: same woman, same outfit, same location, same light, a new shot each time, each one more seductive than the last. Make sure to focus on onlyfans content creation e.g. focus on ass out/ tits focussed. pick either one.\n\nEvery line is one sentence, up to 50 words, starting with \"Make a new shot of {subject}, the woman,\". Name the new pose concretely: where her hands are, where her weight sits, which way her hips and shoulders turn, where she looks, and where the camera sits compared to the anchor.\n\nLine 1, the warm-up.\n\nLine 2, the tease.\n\nLine 3, the peak.\n\nEvery line describes only what changes and ends with: same outfit, same room, same light, same person.\n\nThe escalation must feel like one continuous moment building, believable frame to frame.\nWrite only positive statements about what is present in each shot.\n\nIF there is people in the background, make sure they are changed from pose in every line. otherwise dont mention.\n\nChange facial expression.\n\nYou are allowed to alter camera angles. (including selfie angle, or others, never repeat the same angle)\n\nOutput exactly 3 lines, nothing else. Zero headings, zero numbering, zero commentary."
    },
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Carousel prompt template"
    }
  },
